# The FX menu: a page's button closes it, HOME + SELECT is still the tempo there, and a long SAVE alone on Global only stores (audit U-12, U-13)
# (fxpage: -1 the menu is closed, 0 its keys)
seed 0
wait 500
tap FX
expect fxpage 0
tap ENV
expect fxpage -1
tap FX
expect fxpage 0
press HOME
turn SELECT 2
release HOME
expect fxbank 0
expect fxpage 0
tap GLO
press SAVE
wait 2000
release SAVE
wait 600
expect saved 1
